<title>INDIA: TABLE-India SRF 96/97 net falls sharply.</title>
<headline>TABLE-India SRF 96/97 net falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     146.6   vs    326.5</p>
<p>    Net sales	    6,872.9   vs  6,040.5</p>
<p>    shr (in rupees)	  3.75  vs	8.40</p>
<p>    Div (in percent)	10     vs  not available</p>
<p>    Interest costs     1,137.2   vs    834.4</p>
<p>    Tax			 11.5   vs	0.6</p>
<p>NOTE: SRF Ltd manufactures nylon tyre fabric and related products.</p>
<p>A company statement quoted managing director Arun Bharat Ram saying SRF would aggressively pursue well defined strategies and was committed to enhancing operating efficiencies and financial consolidation.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
